# Secure Password Generator

## Overview

This Python script generates secure random passwords using Python's built-in `secrets` module.

## Skills Demonstrated

- Python
- Randomization
- User Input
- String Manipulation

## How to Run

```bash
python password_generator.py
```

Enter the desired password length when prompted.

## Example Output

```
=== Secure Password Generator ===

Enter password length: 16

Generated Password:
T#7!Lm9@Qa2$HxP%
```
